<title>MOLDOVA: Moldovan leu falls to 4.633 per dollar.</title>
<headline>Moldovan leu falls to 4.633 per dollar.</headline>
<dateline>CHISINAU 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Moldovan leu fell to 4.6330 to the dollar on the Moldovan Interbank Currency Exchange on Wednesday from 4.6265 last Friday.</p>
<p>					   Aug 28		 Aug 23</p>
<p> lei per dollar			4.6330		 4.6265</p>
<p> volume traded ($)		   150,000		25,000</p>
<p>					   Aug 28		 Aug 16</p>
<p> lei per 1,000 roubles	     0.8645		 0.8605</p>
<p> volume traded (R million)	 100		    80</p>
</text>
